active Harmony patches in already-loaded assemblies." /><string id="forge_73a17ab264ba" text="Patch Preflight: Read-only structural check of declared targets and callback references; it never applies patches or invokes callbacks." /><string id="forge_1f256bba1a1f" text="ForgeWeave: Event recording and sequence replay. Harmony Atlas is a separate read-only inventory; Patch Preflight checks blueprint declarations without applying patches." /><string id="forge_a672730bbf7a" text="Event Replay &amp; Patch Diagnostics" /><string id="forge_f264069aa903" text="2. Patch Blueprint Review: Run cf.patch_preflight to review pending declarations. It does not apply patches; applying a Forge method replacement requires a separate explicit opt-in." /><string id="forge_c2aab085005d" text="ForgeWeave Event Pipeline: Deterministic event recording and sequence replay. Harmony diagnostics and Patch Blueprint Preflight are separate tools." /><string id="forge_71f2228b1b4c" text="1. Forge method replacement requires a separate explicit request; declared hook kinds unsupported by the backend remain metadata. Patch Preflight is read-only and does not invoke callback code. Keep ForgeWeave event listeners non-serialized with AddNonSerializedListener." /><string id="forge_0411fe03a551" text="Inventaire des hooks" /><string id="forge_b184dfdeabb9" text="Hook suivant" /><string id="forge_333cac9ef3f2" text="Vérifier la sélection" /><string id="forge_d938e481a39f" text="Aperçu avant application" /><string id="forge_6af44eb7d360" text="Aperçu avant annulation" /><string id="forge_b49a9604ce16" text="Confirmer cette action" /><string id="forge_8639d4025a2a" text="Approuver le plan de hooks affiché" /><string id="forge_c489b8dfe2af" text="Hook sélectionné" /><string id="forge_916497b4c2fd" text="Centrer les preuves" /><string id="forge_9d67b6069665" text="Afficher les outils" /><string id="forge_3a738bcb53b2" text="Navigation rapide" /><string id="forge_241bd2cd0c42" text="Vue active" /><string id="